    "title": "Fix Regression in net_after_fee Function",
    "body": "This patch addresses a regression in the `net_after_fee` function within `ledger_core/fees.py`. The function was incorrectly calculating the net amount by adding the fee rate instead of subtracting it, leading to an assertion error where the expected value was 97.0 but the actual result was 103.0. The fix changes the formula from `amount * (1 + rate)` to `amount * (1 - rate)`, which correctly computes the net amount after the fee. The change has been verified to pass all relevant tests and lint checks in the sandbox. This resolves the regression with high confidence.",
